  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Trying to use animations, whether with hand gestures or the action menu, get stuck as always playing. It's like the integer for the value in the animator somehow gets set to, for example, 2, then when you turn it off it's still set to 2, and playing another animation will also set it to the other number on top of also still being 2. ??? It's either that or it's just not stopping the animations. I thought maybe having other animators on the avatar might be interfering with the avatar, but even after removing them the avatar was still not working correctly. My animations use 2 frames, which I've never had a problem with before on 3.0 avatars, but I mention it in case it helps with anything.\n\nUpdate: Apparently the bug may be local as my friends see my animations fine.",
